<section id="healthcare"><h2 class="display text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900">5. Healthcare appointment tools</h2><p class="mt-3">The appointment platform provides administrative technology such as scheduling, availability management and e-prescription workflows where enabled. It does not diagnose, treat or provide medical advice. Patients should rely on qualified healthcare professionals for care decisions and contact their provider about clinical questions, appointment availability and prescription records.</p><p class="mt-3">Healthcare organizations are responsible for the clinical services they provide, their professional obligations, patient notices and use of patient information. Product availability does not create a clinician-patient relationship with ZassTech.</p></section>
